// Repo layer on top of the shared org preset (renovate-config:default.json5),
// covering what only this repo needs:
//
//   - The fleet's tool pins live in a ROOT-level config.toml (the dogfood
//     inversion: consumers see it as .mise/config.toml, which the preset's
//     ignorePaths excludes). The mise manager's default file patterns only
//     match mise.toml / */mise/config.toml, so the root file is invisible
//     without the pattern below. managerFilePatterns is mergeable — this
//     APPENDS to the defaults — and mise maps config.toml to the sibling
//     mise.lock, which the bot regenerates (`mise lock`) with every pin bump.
//
//   - Tool bumps here ship to the whole fleet via the consumers' .mise
//     submodule, so they land as fix(deps) (overriding the preset's
//     chore(deps) default) and release-please cuts a patch release.
//
//   - The real lockfile is .mise/mise.lock; the root mise.lock the manager
//     targets is a symlink to it (mise places the npm dependency sidecars by
//     the lockfile's physical directory, so only a real .mise/mise.lock
//     records sidecar paths that also resolve in consumers). The manager
//     writes its result through the link and then stages only the unchanged
//     link, so the lock change would never reach the commit. The post-upgrade
//     task writes the artifacts to disk again and sweeps the real file into
//     the commit from git status. Its `true` command does nothing; it exists
//     because Renovate only runs the sweep when a task has a command (`^true$`
//     is in allowedCommands in renovate-config's renovate-global.json5). The
//     sidecars in .mise/locks/ need no help: the manager collects those itself.
//
//   - This repo's own workflow callers are CI plumbing, not library content:
//     actions bumps land as release-please-ignored `ci` (the preset's
//     org-wide fix(deps) is for github-workflows, where the workflows ARE
//     the shipped product) — the same split the old dependabot.yaml made.
{
  $schema: "https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json",
  mise: { managerFilePatterns: ["config.toml"] },
  packageRules: [
    {
      matchManagers: ["mise"],
      semanticCommitType: "fix",
      postUpgradeTasks: {
        commands: ["true"],
        fileFilters: [".mise/mise.lock"],
        executionMode: "branch",
      },
    },
    { matchManagers: ["github-actions"], semanticCommitType: "ci" },
  ],
}
